# Keep local model references current

Lyrics use `llama3.2` via `heartmula_backend/config.py` (`OLLAMA_MODEL`). If that pin changes, update the default and any comment or doc that names the tag, in the same change.

Do not switch this to a general chat model as part of a Paperclip lineup cleanup unless lyrics generation is meant to move. `llama3.2` stays installed for this job.
